  "sourceSummary": "Life Fitness official Plate Loaded Biceps Curl describes the traditional preacher position with angled pad and limited shoulder movement. Generic machine-biceps-curl catalog does not restrict selectorized versus plate-loaded loading, so the approved seated bilateral supinated plate-loaded preacher protocol is a valid exact movement reuse. Legend original validates independent rigid levers; WTG original supplies movement. No new footage or fresh481sample simulation claimed.",
  "motion": "Seated bilateral plate-loaded preacher curl on independent rigid lever arms, both moving simultaneously. Supinated handles, upperarms fixed on contoured31.5degree pad, elbows aligned to machine rotation axis in Y/Z. Each handle and plate horn remains rigidly linked to its pivot. Grounded feet and fixed torso. No cables or floating free barbell.",
